%% Phase2 / timeline / MV3-G11e 统一最新窗口读取
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/timeline/mv3-g11e/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/messageDialog.service.ts::会话摘要 / lastPost 候选（目标：queryMessages latest）；src/pages/message-v3/service/dialogSwitch.service.ts::切群首屏（目标：queryMessages latest）；src/pages/message-v3/service/chatContentShared.service.ts::末条与首屏窗口（目标：复用 latest 结果）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：会话摘要、切群首屏与独立窗口初始化统一读取该频道的有界最新窗口，不再依赖进程内全量缓存
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=not_applicable；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 删除 queryCache 并统一最新窗口读取 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/posts/getLatestPost（复用 G11a；不新增缓存端点）
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message window + timeline cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM-->>E: Command Result {data}
  E-->>Gate: PortReply(Result)
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：返回 G11a 的有界 QueryMessagesResult，messages 按稳定时间线顺序升序；需要 lastPost 的调用方只取该权威 latest 窗口末条，不读取全频道缓存；未知或无可见消息的 channelId 返回关联空窗口 messages:[],hasOlder:false,hasNewer:false；是否补齐陌生频道由 G13b 处理；只读依赖：会话摘要可取 latest 窗口末条作 lastPost 候选，本 Gate 自身不写 channel.lastPost / lastPostAt；对端成员的 viewer-local 未读在本 Gate 前后完全相等（getMemberUnread(channelId, otherUserId).unreadCount 调用前后取值一致），读取动作绝不写对端未读
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：Port、实现、测试替身和业务调用方不得保留 queryCache 符号、兼容别名或动态字符串调用；任一可达命中即 Gate 失败；不得新增 im_query_cached_messages 或返回全频道进程缓存；窗口必须受默认 20 / 最大 60 约束；不得把 queryMessages(latest) 的关联结果发布为 ImGateEvent 业务广播，也不得逐条 emit postReceived
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：无业务事件；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
